    "title": "Thunderbolts force Game 4 in Presidents Cup Final - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ian Young ,\n1 hours ago\nEVANSVILLE, Ind. (WEHT) — The Evansville Thunderbolts took home Game 3 against the Peoria Riverman 2-1.\nThe Thunderbolts play Game 4 at the Ford Center on Thursday. Puck drop is scheduled for 7 p.m.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to Eyewitness News (WEHT/WTVW).",
